{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '390,455p' test/resources/dao/jing/cbor-v1.README.md; rg -n 'meta/decode-meta-with-own-meta|meta/surrogate-under-stripped-line|meta/decode-invalid-utf8-under-line|meta/meta-with-own-meta' test/resources/dao/jing/cbor-v1.json\"","aggregated_output":"- A11: denominator-1 ratios stay tag 30.\n- A1, A2, A7, A12, A13, A14, A15, A16, A17: confirmed as written above.\n\n## Coverage summary\n\nCounts are reproduced by reading `cbor-v1.json`; a case can be in several\ncategories. 372 cases: 209 canonical, 31 encode refusals, 132 decode\nrefusals; 30 equivalence groups and 25 retained-distinction groups.\n114:  {\"id\": \"meta/meta-with-own-meta\", \"kind\": \"encode-refusal\", \"categories\": [\"metadata\"], \"input\": {\"t\": \"vector\", \"items\": [{\"t\": \"int\", \"v\": \"1\"}], \"meta\": {\"t\": \"map\", \"entries\": [[{\"t\": \"keyword\", \"ns\": null, \"name\": \"a\"}, {\"t\": \"int\", \"v\": \"1\"}]], \"meta\": {\"t\": \"map\", \"entries\": [[{\"t\": \"keyword\", \"ns\": null, \"name\": \"doc\"}, {\"t\": \"str\", \"v\": \"d\"}]]}}}, \"hex\": null, \"sha256\": null, \"refusal\": \"malformed-frame\", \"equivalence\": null, \"distinct\": [], \"plan\": \"dao.jing.cbor.md Encoding contract: clojure/with-meta retention, :line/:column/:end-line/:end-column stripping, empty-metadata omission\", \"notes\": \"A metadata map that itself carries metadata: one value has one metadata map (A3/A10 ruling).\"},\n115:  {\"id\": \"meta/surrogate-under-stripped-line\", \"kind\": \"encode-refusal\", \"categories\": [\"metadata\", \"unicode\"], \"input\": {\"t\": \"vector\", \"items\": [{\"t\": \"int\", \"v\": \"1\"}], \"meta\": {\"t\": \"map\", \"entries\": [[{\"t\": \"keyword\", \"ns\": null, \"name\": \"line\"}, {\"t\": \"str\", \"v\": {\"utf16\": [\"d800\"]}}]]}}, \"hex\": null, \"sha256\": null, \"refusal\": \"unpaired-surrogate\", \"equivalence\": null, \"distinct\": [], \"plan\": \"dao.jing.cbor.md Encoding contract: UTF-8 without normalization; surrogate and invalid-UTF-8 rejection; dao.jing.cbor.md Encoding contract: clojure/with-meta retention, :line/:column/:end-line/:end-column stripping, empty-metadata omission\", \"notes\": \"Validate before strip (A9 ruling): a lone surrogate under :line is refused even though :line would be stripped.\"},\n128:  {\"id\": \"meta/decode-meta-with-own-meta\", \"kind\": \"decode-refusal\", \"categories\": [\"metadata\", \"malformed\"], \"input\": null, \"hex\": \"d81b8271636c6f6a7572652f776974682d6d65746182d81b8271636c6f6a7572652f776974682d6d65746182a1d81b827064616f2e6a696e672f6b6579776f726482f663646f636164a1d81b827064616f2e6a696e672f6b6579776f726482f66161018101\", \"sha256\": \"50fb046b5353539359973c6a8cb73bb04e2f05403a799d50abd0d30718aeb543\", \"refusal\": \"malformed-frame\", \"equivalence\": null, \"distinct\": [], \"plan\": \"dao.jing.cbor.md Encoding contract: clojure/with-meta retention, :line/:column/:end-line/:end-column stripping, empty-metadata omission\", \"notes\": \"The metadata map is itself a with-meta frame over a map: metadata must be a bare map (A3/A10 ruling).\"},\n129:  {\"id\": \"meta/decode-invalid-utf8-under-line\", \"kind\": \"decode-refusal\", \"categories\": [\"metadata\", \"malformed\", \"unicode\"], \"input\": null, \"hex\": \"d81b8271636c6f6a7572652f776974682d6d65746182a1d81b827064616f2e6a696e672f6b6579776f726482f6646c696e6563eda0808101\", \"sha256\": \"63945b272de0fd171e1001aa715c4359920733be5e043a11991c24125ae72cf0\", \"refusal\": \"invalid-utf8\", \"equivalence\": null, \"distinct\": [], \"plan\": \"dao.jing.cbor.md Encoding contract: UTF-8 without normalization; surrogate and invalid-UTF-8 rejection; dao.jing.cbor.md Encoding contract: clojure/with-meta retention, :line/:column/:end-line/:end-column stripping, empty-metadata omission\", \"notes\": \"Validate before strip (A9 ruling): an encoded surrogate under :line fails as invalid-utf8. Deliberately two defects (the :line key is also non-canonical) to pin that validation precedes the canonical check.\"},\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
